{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16107270","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16107270","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1610727001:1":{"text":"休，你来这里有什么事？","source_cn":"休，你来这里有什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x984943770DFE72F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610727002:1":{"text":"伊芙特使，我是在这里等你的。我知道现在是特殊时期，但我有个很冒昧的请求……","source_cn":"伊芙特使，我是在这里等你的。我知道现在是特殊时期，但我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9858AE2AB6E4024F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610727003:1":{"text":"我……我希望能协助你调查雷蒙校长死亡一事……无论做什么，哪怕能帮上一点点忙都可以。","source_cn":"我……我希望能协助你调查雷蒙校长死亡一事……无论做什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58BC689E111A083C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610727004:1":{"text":"协助我调查？我想知道你的理由。","source_cn":"协助我调查？我想知道你的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC1A2A62BFB49CF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610727005:1":{"text":"伊芙特使，我来自格伦沃顿家族。雷蒙校长年轻的时候曾与我的祖父一同参加过数次战争，相交颇深。","source_cn":"伊芙特使，我来自格伦沃顿家族。雷蒙校长年轻的时候曾与我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D5DE801D2CCC47C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"